API 密钥及 Spot API 令牌。","sourceName","BleepingComputer","sourceUrl","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/rackspace-spot-breach-let-hackers-access-customer-kubernetes-secrets/","publishedAt","2026-11-21T22:59:58.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,{"_184":211,"_165":-5,"_186":212},{"_184":197,"_165":-5,"_186":198},{"_184":185,"_165":-5,"_186":187},"label","研究与披露","items",[188],{"_162":189,"_53":190,"_165":191,"_167":192,"_169":193,"_171":194,"_173":195,"_175":196,"_177":178,"_179":180},"dfh23lubzfof7rir61cxf0nq4","NebuSec 演示恶意网页劫持 Meta Muse 并读取私人聊天与记忆","NebuSec 演示恶意网页可绕过审批提示，从 Meta Muse 云端机器提取并篡改用户聊天记录与存储记忆，并结合内置浏览器和 Linux 内核缺陷取得机器控制权，访问凭据存储、保存文件及 Sentinel。攻击仅影响单台云端机器，未进入共享服务器或其他用户设备；研究为实验室演示，NebuSec 称所披露弱点均已修复，但 Meta 尚未公开确认，补丁发布前是否有用户数据被访问也未说明。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/a-single-malicious-webpage-let.html","2026-11-21T11:53:07.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","攻击与威胁",[199,200],{"_162":206,"_53":207,"_165":208,"_167":168,"_169":209,"_171":210,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":201,"_53":202,"_165":203,"_167":168,"_169":204,"_171":205,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180},"dbml5ujd9k2y3agezdbxfdnmx","BADBOX 3.0 botnet 回归，每日发起 40 亿次欺诈广告竞价请求","HUMAN 的 Satori 研究人员发现 BADBOX 3.0 通过受感染的 Android 设备每日发起约 40 billion 次欺诈广告竞价请求，峰值占其观察到的 CTV 流量的 4% 以上。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/badbox-30-botnet-returns-with-record-breaking-40-billion-daily-ad-requests/","2026-11-21T15:17:27.000Z","lwn1awdsmrazlhsmt4r21vq0w","Microsoft Entra Connect Health 漏洞遭利用，租户数据被未授权访问","攻击者利用 Microsoft Entra Connect Health API 漏洞，未授权读取租户级元数据，并可能修改 Connect Health 监控配置。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/microsoft-entra-connect-health-flaw-exploited-to-steal-tenant-data/","2026-11-21T18:01:58.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[213],{"_162":134,"_53":117,"_165":214,"_167":192,"_169":215,"_171":216,"_173":195,"_175":196,"_177":178,"_179":180},"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 的 4 个漏洞列入 KEV，依据是已发现活跃利用证据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploit-critical-vmware-cisco.html","2026-11-21T08:49:13.000Z",{"_162":206,"_53":207,"_165":208,"_167":168,"_169":209,"_171":210,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":201,"_53":202,"_165":203,"_167":168,"_169":204,"_171":205,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":189,"_53":190,"_165":191,"_167":192,"_169":193,"_171":194,"_173":195,"_175":196,"_177":178,"_179":180},"leadParagraph",{"_222":223,"_224":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
